NOTICE
=====

This repository contains original glue code and orchestration for closed-loop co-simulation. It deliberately vendors none of its upstreams: the in-container stack is fetched and patched at runtime (Patch+fetch), model weights and engines are built in separate repositories, and the simulator is installed separately. The components this project builds on:

| Component | Upstream | Upstream license | Where in this repo |
|---|---|---|---|
| carla_apollo_bridge (base of the in-container stack) | https://github.com/guardstrikelab/carla_apollo_bridge (pinned b0c2e08) | Apache-2.0 | fetched and patched at setup time; our patch series in [patches/bridge/](patches/bridge/) |
| carla_apollo_bridge lineage | https://github.com/AuroAi/carla_apollo_bridge (original) | Apache-2.0 | lineage only |
| carla-apollo co-sim context | https://github.com/casper-auto/carla-apollo | — | lineage/context |
| Apollo v8.0.0 runtime | https://github.com/ApolloAuto/apollo | Apache-2.0 | runtime container + control module (the refined MPC files under patches/apollo/refined_mpc/ derive from the bridge's refined_controller/, see row 1) |
| CARLA 0.9.15 | https://github.com/carla-simulator/carla | MIT | installed separately; not distributed here |
| TensorRT / CUDA | NVIDIA | Apache-2.0 / NVIDIA software license | inference runtime (host side) |
| VAD model lineage | https://github.com/hustvl/VAD | Apache-2.0 | model lineage only; engines built by hous-lab/vad-trt-edge |
| SparseDriveV2 model lineage | https://github.com/swc-17/SparseDriveV2 (bench2drive branch) | Apache-2.0 | model lineage only; engines built by hous-lab/sparsedrive-trt-edge |
